Z||000015||1FST2M6||10-26-2000||10:25 AM||||bout 10k cheaper!!! parts are more expensive though.. not sure how they are liscensed.. but you CAn import i think 1-2 grey market cars under a private name (eg. Travis Hall imported through Paul Spruell and tag it as a gry market) MANY MANY MANY Mercededs are like this! 72-88 300 series with one piece headlamps.. had to deal with them a lot at NOPI. but you can't just go buy it.. the Ford Cosworth RS 300-500 are imported the same way, as are the N33 Nissan Skylines. and the WRX WAS imported like that but they are available now at the dealer... but they have not passed crash tests and your insurance will be the same as an S2000 BUT you'll have the better car!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>Shhh.. Top Secret! <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fstcheeto_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
