Z||000018||william_thorniii||10-26-2000||12:40 PM||||87EC05,<P>I don't know about that.  Of course I would like to see GM market another great two seater as I will be in the market for a new vehicle in a few years.  Unfortunately from what I have seen in the past, many folks will voice their opinion that it should be produced that would NEVER consider buying it... so if you want the car produced and are in the market for a Boxter, S2000, Z3, SLK or similar then perhaps you should let them know what you think.  <P>On a side note, I do understand that the Lotus and Opel over in Europe are relatively cheap... but if it were ever to come over here, I am confident that GM would need a larger margin for the small market and new manufacturing requirements. <P>This is just my rupie's worth though,<P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||1
